 ### [Standard Interval Tree for Isosurface Extraction](1230-standard-interval-tree-for-isosurface-extraction.md)
-Uses interval trees for traversal instead of explicit face/edge/vertex enumeration.
+Uses interval trees to cull empty space and traverse only relevant regions, differing from explicit face/edge/vertex enumeration. Choose it when scene sparsity is high and memory bandwidth is a bottleneck [G].
 
